{"skill":{"slug":"stock-research-engine","displayName":"stock-research-engine"},"version":{"version":"3.0.0","createdAt":1772683349471,"changelog":"- Major upgrade with a new, rigorous buy-side investment research process.\n- Now covers A-shares, Hong Kong, and US stocks; triggered by stock symbols, names, or investment analysis requests.\n- Outputs a structured, concise Markdown brief focused on investment decision-making, with explicit separation of facts and opinions.\n- Analysis includes market sentiment, company fundamentals, management assessment, business breakdown, catalyst calendar, risks, and valuation, all with strict data discipline.\n- Prioritizes cross-verified, up-to-date financials and user-provided data; avoids speculation and filler.\n- Designed for both single and batch stock analysis, supporting rapid, high-density research.","changelogSource":"auto","license":null,"files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":3382,"sha256":"de09492bf0b533fd4829243502566cf32d48037797993e571a8c57adfcc6bd6b","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"_meta.json","size":116,"sha256":"7e4cfe0fa11f70cd63f73f17fcae1b54022544acfd2b23ea26c3a5c574b8f4ab","contentType":"application/json"},{"path":"references/analysis-framework.md","size":8161,"sha256":"b6bf44dbac53e6cfe9d84fadfc7552cbb05027cb31b7318a920ad37026948506","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2217,"sha256":"bd6f4278a31069e89f8ab9f1fbacc66432434b0094c9d16775e78d08895c2b26","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789104075888,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"fec0dad3e0a700ed84c0a674d1068825cf2f009c7fb8449d0cb60a8cb5bea11e","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/fec0dad3e0a700ed84c0a674d1068825cf2f009c7fb8449d0cb60a8cb5bea11e","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1780085693223},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":22,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":3,"checkedAt":1789104075888},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This is a plain Markdown stock-research skill whose network/data use is aligned with financial analysis, with no code execution, persistence, credential access, or destructive behavior found.","dimensions":[{"detail":"The skill asks the agent to search public financial and company information sources, which is proportionate to producing timely stock research; it does not request local file indexing, private data stores, sessions, cookies, or account access.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The package contains only Markdown and JSON metadata files; no executable installer, dependency setup, scripts, or remote payload retrieval were present.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The trigger wording is broad for company names, stock tickers, and generic Chinese stock-analysis phrases, and the skill content is written in Chinese without language-choice guidance; this may affect routing or usability but does not create a material security concern.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No persistence, background workers, scheduled tasks, privilege escalation, tool wrapping, memory writes, or system modifications were found.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is deep stock fundamental research, and the artifact instructions consistently focus on gathering current market, financial, governance, catalyst, risk, and valuation information for A-share, Hong Kong, and U.S. stocks.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install this if you want a Chinese-language stock research workflow that relies on current public financial data searches. Be aware it may trigger on broad company or ticker questions, and its outputs can influence investment thinking, so users should verify figures and treat conclusions as analysis rather than financial advice.","findings":"[SQP-3] expected: The artifacts are Chinese-language stock-analysis instructions. This supports the scanner's usability concern, but it is disclosed by the content and does not indicate hidden behavior or security-relevant authority.\n[SQP-1] expected: The broad activation examples are real and could route some generic company or ticker requests into this workflow, but the resulting behavior remains stock-research analysis rather than privileged, destructive, or deceptive activity.\n[SQP-3] expected: The referenced analysis framework is also entirely in Chinese. That is a product-scope and user-preference issue, not evidence of malicious or Review-level security behavior.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789104075888}}}}}